    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Estela,\n\nMy earlier note about organizing case information was a little broad. For you as the attorney leading the practice, a more useful starting point might be one small task with an output you can check quickly.\n\nI'm Pranav, founder of Possible Minds. We help PI firms adopt AI, and I'm trying to understand where it would genuinely help before building around assumptions.\n\nOn your injury matters, would a concise case summary or a checklist of missing records be more helpful? Even a brief answer would help, and I'd appreciate your time.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "where AI could compound at Law Office of Estela S. Richeda",
